title V5 - Shared team deployment (proposed)
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Teams [color: gray] {
  Team A apps [icon: users]
  Team B chatbot [icon: users]
}

Ingestion workers [color: green] {
  Document watcher [icon: eye]
  Ingest pipeline [icon: upload]
}

Shared services [color: blue] {
  RAG API service [icon: server]
  Embedding server [icon: cpu]
  LLM server [icon: message-circle]
  Reranker [icon: bar-chart-2]
}

Storage [color: purple] {
  Object storage MinIO [shape: cylinder, icon: archive]
  Postgres pgvector replicas [shape: cylinder, icon: database]
}

Document watcher > Ingest pipeline: new or changed files
Ingest pipeline > Object storage MinIO: raw PDFs and images
Ingest pipeline > Embedding server
Ingest pipeline > Postgres pgvector replicas: chunks + vectors + team ACL
Team A apps > RAG API service: question + team
Team B chatbot > RAG API service
RAG API service > Embedding server
RAG API service <> Postgres pgvector replicas: filtered by team and embed model
RAG API service > Reranker
RAG API service > LLM server
RAG API service > Team A apps: grounded answer
